  "description": "<div style=\"font-family:Poppins;\"><div><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\">• <strong>About our brand and products:</strong> Quantum is a revolutionary vacuum brand utilizing water technology to vacuum, mop and sanitize your home. The Quantum W is a our latest release and with over $50 million in US sales our product is in high demand.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• <strong>What makes us different:</strong> The Quantum W stands out from traditional vacuums because it uses water as its filtration system instead of bags or standard HEPA filters. Dirt, dust, pet hair, and allergens are trapped directly in water, which helps prevent particles from blowing back into the air and keeps suction strong throughout the entire cleaning session since there’s no filter to clog. It can handle both dry debris and liquid spills, and it even functions as an air purifier when run with clean water. Plus, there are no recurring bag or filter replacement costs—just empty the dirty water and refill—making it a powerful and practical alternative to conventional vacuums.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How affiliates can earn: Earn up to 20% per vacuum sold, super affiliates we are open to increasing the percentage paid per vacuum sold.</p><p style=\"text-align:left;font-size:14px;font-weight:normal;\"><br>• How to promote us: You can promote us on websites, socials, email and any other creative formats available. </p></div></div>",
